W Bullion — README

A real-time earning platform for the Nigerian market. Built on Vercel + Supabase + Cloudinary.

---

🏗️ Architecture

Layer Tech Purpose
Frontend Vanilla JS (ES modules) + Tailwind-like CSS SPA, no build step
Hosting Vercel Static + serverless functions
Database Supabase (Postgres) Users, balances, transactions, reels metadata
Realtime Supabase Realtime Live updates (replaces polling)
File Storage Cloudinary Reels (100 MB max), screenshots
Auth Supabase Auth User sessions
Email Nodemailer (Gmail) Activation receipts

---

📁 Project Structure

```
/
├── vercel.json              # Vercel routing + headers
├── index.html               # Main SPA shell
├── admin.html               # Admin dashboard (Phase 4)
├── favicon.ico
├── README.md
├── .env.example             # Local reference (do not commit real keys)
├── api/
│   ├── env.js               # Public env var bridge
│   └── ...                  # More serverless functions in later phases
├── css/
│   └── theme.css            # Theme variables + boot + navbar + modal
├── js/
│   ├── main.js              # Entry point + boot + route registration
│   ├── config.js            # Fetches /api/env
│   ├── supabase.js          # Supabase client
│   ├── router.js            # SPA router
│   ├── modal.js             # Custom alerts/confirm/prompt/toast
│   ├── navbar.js            # Bottom nav controller
│   └── boot.js              # Boot sequence
└── images/
    ├── logo.png             # Required
    ├── vbadge.png           # Phase 6
    └── players/             # Phase 7 (football takers)
```

